{"server":"tw","storyId":"act23side_level_act23side_03_beg","groupId":"act23side","stageId":"act23side_03","title":"樹猶如此","storyCode":"WB-3","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act23side/level_act23side_03_beg.txt","sourceHash":"66c89ee405cfb7f010e0a08c2360e8beacf3686fab80e271b745a2ec72bea60c","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"神秘少女在鑄劍坊找到了孟鐵衣，坦白了自己的身份，原來她與重岳似乎還有些恩怨。因為故人的情誼，孟鐵衣決定幫助少女逃出城去。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g6_yumengate"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤怒的武人","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓我們出去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡防營守軍","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"該說的話剛才已經說過了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡防營守軍","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"將軍有令，為了玉門安危，戒嚴期間，任何人不得擅自出城。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡防營守軍","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請回吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤怒的武人","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你跟我講玉門安危？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤怒的武人","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們守玉門城的時候，你小子還沒摸過刀呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡防營守軍","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡防營守軍","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"非常時期，請大家以大局為重。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤怒的武人","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大局為重？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤怒的武人","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那年一夥流寇潛入城中偷搶錢財，傷了好幾個無辜百姓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤怒的武人","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事發突然，不清楚具體情況，你們守軍不敢妄動，是我們哥幾個追了出去，整整三天，在沙漠裡追出去幾百里地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤怒的武人","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們背著只剩一口氣的兄弟，最終把賊人逮回城裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤怒的武人","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在是我們的兄弟死在了城外，屍骨都沒能收回來，你讓我們在這裡等著？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡防營守軍","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"荊前輩，我們都聽過您的故事，也很敬重您。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡防營守軍","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但左將軍有令，城中正在緝拿要犯，沒有他本人特許，任何人不得出入玉門。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤怒的武人","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好大的威風！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤怒的武人","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就叫左宣遼出來見我們！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"放肆！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤怒的武人","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"坊主......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟鐵衣 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大老遠就聽到你們在這嚷嚷，這些當兵的兄弟也是奉了上頭的命令，何必為難他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤怒的武人","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這口氣，我們咽不下......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟鐵衣 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們都是城裡的老人了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟鐵衣 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"參與過幾次守城的戰鬥，頂著天災護送過幾次信使，這玉門城的安定，有你們一份辛苦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟鐵衣 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但平祟侯還在，宗師也還在，哪裡輪得到你們靠資歷擺譜？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"失落的武人","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"坊主，你難道心裡......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟鐵衣 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好漢不提當年勇，那點事，不拿出來說，也有人記得。記不得的，說了也沒用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟鐵衣 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先回去，別鬧事。有我在，死去的兄弟們少不了說法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡防營守軍","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"失落的武人","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......知道了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟鐵衣 (B)","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是我管教無方，給大傢伙添麻煩了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡防營守軍","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不怪孟前輩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡防營守軍","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那四位武行的兄弟......孟前輩節哀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟鐵衣 (B)","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們的家人，我會負責照顧，不勞平祟侯費心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟鐵衣 (B)","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但他們是死在為玉門送信的路上，我想替大夥問一句，平祟侯對這件事，到底有什麼說法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡防營守軍","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事分輕重緩急，等捉拿了城中刺客，平祟侯一定會出兵清剿流寇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟鐵衣 (B)","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好......“輕重緩急”，言之有理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟鐵衣 (B)","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是要平祟侯的一句話，不管這句話是什麼，我都帶去回覆弟兄們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟鐵衣 (B)","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等事了，還是歡迎大夥再來鑄劍坊喝酒。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g1_yumenstreet_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雨霞姐。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們那邊情況怎麼樣？犧牲者的家屬，有沒有找到？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遙夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其實四個人中，有兩人都是獨自生活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遙夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至於另外兩人，家屬恰好都不在家，我們冒昧闖了進去......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有些奇怪，他們的家中一如往常......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遙夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也可能是家屬正好外出不在......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"昨日信使隊伍遇難的消息傳回，已經過去了整整一天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g1_yumenstreet_d"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g1_yumenstreet_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誰？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遙夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嚇我一跳！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剛才突然覺得，好像有人在盯著我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遙夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這大街上來來往往這麼多人，你還能注意到？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回客棧再說。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"林雨霞，留步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是這個人......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我和這人說幾句話，你們等我一會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遙夜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒想到肅政院的監察御史還記得我。上次見面應該已經是五年前了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那次見面的時機，令人難忘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但不太令人愉快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"公事公辦，你我皆是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"林特使在這裡，也是在調查玉門城中事變了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"御史有什麼指教？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不。在下此時並非以官身介入。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是作為平祟侯舊部，作為大炎子民，捉拿禍亂百姓安生的奸徒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太合御史這次不勸我置身事外，我反倒是有點意外了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"林特使有職責在身，在下沒有理由勸阻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請恕在下多事一問。林特使初到玉門，對城中情形還不算熟悉，你打算如何查案？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我當然有自己的手段，不勞太合御史操心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也相信林特使的手段，自然有過人之處。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太合御史不妨把話說清楚一些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還是剛才的話，公事公辦，僅此而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在下只是來提醒林特使，敵暗我明，千萬小心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"告辭。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遙夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個大塊頭，我在尚蜀見過......好像是肅政院的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遙夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你到底還認識多少大官？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是認識，只是打過交道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遙夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有什麼區別？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"區別在於，一些打交道的人，你並不想認識。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先回去吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g5_swordcastingworkshop"},{"type":"narration","text":"薄暮。\n早春時節，日頭下去得快，天氣還是有些冷。\n老人往火爐裡填了一把柴。\n這點火沒法鍛造，甚至不能用來取暖。但是在工坊所有設備都用源石點火的今天，老人還是固執地留下了這樣一個無用的爐子。\n等爐火燒旺的工夫，他拿起掃帚，細細清掃起院落裡昨夜積下的沙子，每一處石磚間的縫隙都不放過。\n老人當然知道，現在打掃乾淨，不一會又會落滿一地的沙。\n但他還是不厭其煩地，一遍又一遍地掃著地，彷彿就為了看一眼工坊階淨台明的樣子。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟鐵衣 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這腿腳喲，回暖了，也還是凍得有些發疼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟鐵衣 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個時間準備關門了。不急的話，等明天再過來吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟鐵衣 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟鐵衣 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"姑娘是不是找錯了地方，這裡是工坊，不是醫館。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"異族裝扮的少女","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在找......一個故事裡的地方......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟鐵衣 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一個傷得這麼重的人，不該在城裡亂跑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟鐵衣 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然不願意這麼講，但眼下城中戒嚴，一個身受刀傷的人突然出現在家門口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟鐵衣 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要是不把姑娘抓起來交給官府，那就是我有問題了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟鐵衣 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也不想多生事端，還是麻煩姑娘說明一下來歷吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"異族裝扮的少女","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......是不是叫孟鐵衣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟鐵衣 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如今城裡能直接叫出這個名字的年輕人，我總該有點印象。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟鐵衣 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我卻不認得你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"異族裝扮的少女","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"師父說過，在移動城市裡，藏著一個工坊。工坊的主人，是一個本領高強的刀匠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"異族裝扮的少女","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他會打造各種各樣的武器和鎧甲，也會做些有趣的小玩具送給城裡的孩子......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟鐵衣 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟鐵衣 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我一時都想不起來，還有誰會這麼形容我這個老頭子......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"異族裝扮的少女","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在工坊的院子裡，種著一棵槐樹。是你們一起從很遠的地方移栽回來的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"老人不由得回首。\n院子的一角，一株槐樹迎著晚風微微擺首。北地春遲，樹枝上還沒有長出新葉。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g11_yumendesert"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朔","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到了這裡，這一仗才算真正結束了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣遼","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們也有不少死傷......但至少二十年，這幫賊寇再難成什麼氣候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朔","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽說古人遠征大勝，會在最遠處的山岩上刻錄自己的戰功。今天這一仗，也值得我們效仿古人遺風了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣遼","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈，倒是不錯，但這附近都是沙漠，放眼過去也沒什麼能寫字的地方......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朔","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只有這邊孤零零的一棵樹，那不如就——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟鐵衣","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"負劍的女俠","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好什麼好！你們沒看見這棵樹都快枯死了，還要折騰它？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朔","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你出個主意？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"負劍的女俠","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"移動城市千里奔行，漂泊不定，把戰功刻在一個固定的所在又有什麼意思？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"負劍的女俠","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們今天在此見到了這棵樹，不如就把它帶回去，種在玉門。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"負劍的女俠","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"它在玉門城裡紮根生長一日，我們今天的故事就能被銘記一日。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朔","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（撫掌）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朔","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，好。這主意不錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟鐵衣","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你們是不是被太陽曬暈了頭......此地離玉門城足足有一百里，你們是打算把這棵樹扛回去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朔","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這有何妨，來的時候那麼多糧食和水都吃完了，回去的時候多帶一棵樹又怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朔","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"左兄，鐵衣兄弟，來幫忙。小心別挖斷了樹根。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g5_swordcastingworkshop"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟鐵衣 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟鐵衣 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你叫她師父......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"異族裝扮的少女","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"師父在荒野上救了我和族人，教我們安家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟鐵衣 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你叫什麼名字？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"異族裝扮的少女","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"截雲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟鐵衣 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我沒看錯，你是阿納薩......卻有一個這麼風雅的名字？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截雲","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"師父取的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟鐵衣 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難怪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟鐵衣 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“雲動千里雨，截在此山晴。”她是希望你們從此不再漂泊無依吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截雲","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"師父念得比你好，但她說的，也是這樣的意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟鐵衣 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哈哈，那是肯定的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟鐵衣 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說起來，宗師的名字也是她取的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截雲","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個薄情寡義的人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟鐵衣 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這又是從何說起......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟鐵衣 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，你身上這把劍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟鐵衣 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你偷了宗師的佩劍？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截雲","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要把這把劍，帶到師父的墳頭，祭拜。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"風吹葉動，老槐樹沙沙作響。\n爐子裡的火熄滅了，天色更加暗沉。但老人沒有動。\n少女看不清他的表情。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟鐵衣 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她——死了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截雲","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。師父的病很嚴重。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截雲","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"師父最後的心願，就是再看一眼這把劍，我必須給她個交代......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截雲","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也要搶嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟鐵衣 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我當然不會。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟鐵衣 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"玉門現在很危險。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截雲","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，拿了這把劍，城裡的軍人都在抓我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟鐵衣 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我是說，這座城接下來會很危險。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟鐵衣 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這座城接下來會迎接一個考驗。但在那之前，我至少應該，把你送出去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟鐵衣 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的師父在等一個交代......我們這些人，都在等一個交代。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截雲","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，要怎麼出城？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截雲","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來的時候沒有想過。城門也已經封了，硬闖的話......我受了傷。"},{"type":"narration","text":"起了風。\n一些細沙揚到了老人的臉上，落入歲月的溝壑中。\n沾著早春暮間的濕氣，柔軟。\n老人用手撚了撚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟鐵衣 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟鐵衣 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我有辦法。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g1_yumenstreet_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喲，您回來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"情況怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跑腿的路人","speakerId":"avg_npc_798_1","isRemote":false,"text":"醫館沒有醫生也沒有夥計，只見到一個穿官服的公子哥，問我去幹什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那您怎麼說......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跑腿的路人","speakerId":"avg_npc_798_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就按你說的，“昨夜裡商店貨架倒了，家裡人被砸破了腦袋，送來醫館的時候匆忙沒帶錢，現在把醫藥費補上”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跑腿的路人","speakerId":"avg_npc_798_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那公子哥問完我這句話也就走了。不明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跑腿的路人","speakerId":"avg_npc_798_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喏，讓我送的錢沒送出去，還給你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您收下吧，一點辛苦費。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"跑腿的路人","speakerId":"avg_npc_798_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真奇怪，玉門的旅遊季錢這麼好賺了嗎......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"知道鯉先生手眼通天，可現在竟然都忽悠到晚輩身上了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那位公子哪能算什麼晚輩，他可是司歲台的秉燭人，我哪來的膽子去騙他......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幫他排除一個錯誤答案罷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"林先生這是......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"閒逛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"換作是在龍門的市民公園遇見您，我也就信了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"鯉先生這邊可有進展？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說來奇怪，林先生托我的事情還沒眉目，反倒是我要找的那個人有了點線索。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"那也是好事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"林先生把事情交給我，自己也不見得放心，為什麼不親自出手？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"要我出手，就是直接去拂魏彥吾的面子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"我也正好在一旁看看，她是怎麼辦事的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不愧是林先生，事情到了這個節骨眼，還有餘裕下一著試應手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"磨刀不誤砍柴工。也是鯉先生值得信賴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"鯉先生最終沒能留在近衛局，魏彥吾還常常感慨來著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就別提了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"魏彥吾啊......從不放過任何一個能派上用場的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"話說回來，林先生還是下定決心要讓雨霞姑娘接您的班了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"這不該由我說了算。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"她要是想留下，龍門自然有她的安身之所，她要是想離開，龍門也不該是她的後顧之憂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"無論她選哪條路，我都想拜託鯉先生，能給她一些照應。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能讓林先生這麼信任，是我的榮幸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雨霞姑娘那邊，幫得上忙的，我會上心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"多謝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"那我接著溜噠，就不打擾鯉先生了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"槐天裴啊槐天裴，同樣是父親......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g5_swordcastingworkshop"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟鐵衣 (B)","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你來的路上，有沒有留意到巡防營發佈的全城通知？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟鐵衣 (B)","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"根據欽天監觀測台的最新測算結果，為了躲避天災，玉門城需要修改航向。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟鐵衣 (B)","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明天申時起，整座城市開始減速，大概酉時三刻左右，它的行進速度會降至最低，航線修正完畢後再重新加速。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟鐵衣 (B)","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那便是你的機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截雲","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，城市減速，城門的防守應該會更加嚴密才對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟鐵衣 (B)","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"孩子，進入玉門前，你有沒有好好看過這座城市？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟鐵衣 (B)","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"千里大漠，人跡罕至，禍亂頻生，但仍是大炎疆土。玉門打一開始，便是作為鎮守北方的軍事堡壘而設計。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟鐵衣 (B)","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正因如此，有別於常規的移動城市，玉門在外牆處特別加造了“沙渠”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g6_yumengate"},{"type":"narration","text":"聽說土木天師從江南水鄉的“水車”得到靈感，將之化用進了這座塞上城市。\n移動城市的基座沉入沙地，但以源石技藝驅動的巨大輪機無時無刻不在運轉著，將黃沙排出，卸去阻力。\n得益於這些“沙渠”，玉門城在浩瀚的沙漠裡長驅直入，視軍情而靈活移動。\n如江吐浪，馭潮而動，蔚為壯觀。"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g5_swordcastingworkshop"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截雲","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟鐵衣 (B)","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正常來講，沙渠絕不會成為人通行的道路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟鐵衣 (B)","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人如果跳進沙渠，可能會被輪機絞碎，也可能會被翻滾的黃沙淹沒而窒息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟鐵衣 (B)","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明天酉時，玉門行進速度降至最低，也將是沙渠運轉最慢的時候......或許還有一絲可能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截雲","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那也要試！我必須要出城。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟鐵衣 (B)","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是你的傷？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截雲","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟鐵衣 (B)","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截雲","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之前已經在醫館處理過了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟鐵衣 (B)","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟鐵衣 (B)","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是，沙渠通常不會有太多防守，但現在情況特殊，全城戒嚴，不知道有沒有什麼變化。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截雲","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來的路上，聽說現在是這座城的將軍親自在城樓領兵佈防。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟鐵衣 (B)","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟鐵衣 (B)","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"該見不該見，終歸是要見一面。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截雲 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要出去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟鐵衣 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事不宜遲，我得去探查一下情況。而且要想從沙渠出城，也還有些準備工作要做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟鐵衣 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我出去的時候會在門口掛上暫停營業的牌子，你趁這段時間好好養傷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟鐵衣 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我到時候回來接你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g04_yaninn"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"大小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"雨霞姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們先去我房間，我馬上就來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有什麼發現？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龍門暗樁","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"您走之後不久，裡面出來了一些鐵匠打扮的人，拉著貨物往別的地方去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龍門暗樁","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我嘗試跟蹤，但對面顯然也是行家，察覺到有人跟著，很快就把我甩開了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龍門暗樁","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我回過頭再去查看倉庫，裡面東西已經被清得一乾二淨。雖然不知道這夥人在隱藏什麼，但顯然事有蹊蹺......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龍門暗樁","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"小姐直覺沒錯，那個鑄劍坊多半有問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恐怕現在已經打草驚蛇，而我們還沒有找到關鍵證據。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"城頭的烏雲好像一天比一天厚，風裡的沙子也越來越多了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事態緊急。既然有所懷疑，那就試探試探。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g9_yumensuburb"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g04_yaninn"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龍門暗樁","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"大小姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你去趟軍營，替我取個東西。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
